  - key: first_contact.terminal.meaning.unknown
    sourceText: '[MEANING?]'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[\uC758\uBBF8?]"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.category.danger.descriptor
    sourceText: concrete visible subjects whose ordinary identity is a source or
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC778 \uC815\uCCB4\uC131\uC774 \uC704\uD574, \uC704\uD611,
        \uBD80\uC0C1, \uC911\uB3C5, \uD654\uC7AC, \uD3ED\uBC1C, \uACF5\uACA9 \uB610\uB294
        \uAE30\uD0C0 \uC9C1\uC811\uC801\uC778 \uC704\uD5D8\uC758 \uC6D0\uC778\uC774\uB098
        \uC218\uB2E8\uC778 \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC774\uACE0 \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294
        \uB300\uC0C1"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.category.protection.descriptor
    sourceText: concrete visible subjects whose ordinary identity is protection,
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC778 \uC815\uCCB4\uC131\uC774 \uBCF4\uD638, \uBC29\uC5B4,
        \uD53C\uB09C, \uACBD\uACC4 \uB610\uB294 \uC704\uD574 \uCC28\uB2E8\uC778 \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC774\uACE0
        \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294 \uB300\uC0C1"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.category.food.descriptor
    sourceText: concrete visible subjects whose ordinary identity is something eaten,
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC778 \uC815\uCCB4\uC131\uC774 \uBA39\uAC70\uB098
        \uB9C8\uC2DC\uAC70\uB098 \uC2DD\uC0AC\uB85C \uC900\uBE44\uB418\uAC70\uB098
        \uC2DD\uD488\uC73C\uB85C \uC0AC\uC6A9\uB418\uB294 \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC774\uACE0
        \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294 \uB300\uC0C1"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.category.tool.descriptor
    sourceText: concrete visible subjects whose ordinary identity is a tool, instrument,
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uBC18\uC801\uC778 \uC815\uCCB4\uC131\uC774 \uC791\uC5C5\uC744
        \uC218\uD589\uD558\uB294 \uB370 \uC4F0\uC774\uB294 \uB3C4\uAD6C, \uAE30\uAD6C,
        \uC7A5\uCE58 \uB610\uB294 \uC791\uC5C5\uC6A9 \uBB3C\uD488\uC778 \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC774\uACE0
        \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294 \uB300\uC0C1"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.translator_ready
    sourceText: TRANSLATOR READY
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30 \uC900\uBE44\uB428"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.meaning_map_seeded
    sourceText: MEANING MAP SEEDED
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC758\uBBF8 \uC9C0\uB3C4 \uCD08\uAE30\uD654\uB428"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.channel.probe_sequence
    sourceText: PROBE SEQUENCE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD45C\uBCF8 \uC2DC\uD000\uC2A4"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.draw_one_object
    sourceText: DRAW ONE OBJECT
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C \uD558\uB098\uB97C \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.draw_something
    sourceText: DRAW SOMETHING
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBB34\uC5B8\uAC00\uB97C \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.draw_one_object_only
    sourceText: DRAW ONE OBJECT ONLY
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C\uC740 \uD558\uB098\uB9CC \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.text_or_symbol_detected
    sourceText: TEXT OR SYMBOL DETECTED
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBB38\uC790 \uB610\uB294 \uAE30\uD638 \uAC10\uC9C0\uB428"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.scene_or_action_detected
    sourceText: SCENE OR ACTION DETECTED
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC7A5\uBA74 \uB610\uB294 \uD589\uB3D9 \uAC10\uC9C0\uB428"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.reason.object_not_clear
    sourceText: OBJECT NOT CLEAR
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C \uD310\uB3C5 \uBD88\uAC00"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_mismatch
    sourceText: LABEL MISMATCH
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8 \uBD88\uC77C\uCE58"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.fallback.unknown
    sourceText: UNKNOWN
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC54C \uC218 \uC5C6\uC74C"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.cluster.stable
    sourceText: STABLE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC548\uC815"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.cluster.forming
    sourceText: FORMING
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD615\uC131 \uC911"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.cluster.unchanged
    sourceText: UNCHANGED
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBCC0\uD654 \uC5C6\uC74C"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.cluster.unstable
    sourceText: UNSTABLE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBD88\uC548\uC815"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.semantic_map.group
    sourceText: GROUP
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC758\uBBF8 \uD328\uD134"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.semantic_map.group_unknown
    sourceText: '[GROUP-??]'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[\uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134-??]"
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.bootstrap_duplicate_probe
    sourceText: The same sample repeats the same response. Try a different object
      in the same category.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAC19\uC740 \uADF8\uB9BC\uC740 \uAC19\uC740 \uBC18\uC751\uB9CC \uBC18\uBCF5\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uAC19\uC740 \uBD84\uB958\uC758 \uB2E4\uB978 \uC0AC\uBB3C \uADF8\uB9BC\uC744
        \uBCF4\uB0B4 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.bootstrap_category_mismatch
    sourceText: The aliens responded and the data was recorded, but the drawing does
      not appear to belong to {category}.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB9BC\uC5D0 \uBC18\uC751\uD574\uC11C \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB3C4
        \uC218\uC9D1\uB418\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uD558\uC9C0\uB9CC {category}\uC5D0
        \uD574\uB2F9\uD558\uB294 \uADF8\uB9BC\uC740 \uC544\uB2CC \uBAA8\uC591\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_blank
    sourceText: The drawing is too empty to read. Draw one visible object.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB9BC\uC744 \uC548\uADF8\uB9AC\uC2E0 \uAC83 \uAC19\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uADF8\uB9BC\uC744 \uD558\uB098 \uADF8\uB824\uC8FC\uC2DC\uC9C0\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_text_or_symbol
    sourceText: The sample includes text or symbols. Draw the object without writing.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB9BC\uC5D0 \uAE00\uC790\uB098 \uAE30\uD638\uAC00 \uB4E4\uC5B4
        \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC21C\uC218\uD55C \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC758 \uADF8\uB9BC\uB9CC\uC744
        \uC81C\uCD9C\uD574\uC57C \uC815\uD655\uD55C \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB97C \uC5BB\uC744
        \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_scene_or_action
    sourceText: This looks like a scene or action. Draw one object by itself.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774 \uADF8\uB9BC\uC740 \uC7A5\uBA74\uC774\uB098 \uD589\uB3D9\uC73C\uB85C
        \uBCF4\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4. \n\uC21C\uC218\uD55C \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC758 \uADF8\uB9BC\uB9CC
        \uADF8\uB824\uC8FC\uC154\uC57C \uC815\uD655\uD55C \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB97C
        \uC5BB\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_multiple_objects
    sourceText: More than one object is detected. Leave only one object.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C\uC774 \uB458 \uC774\uC0C1 \uAC10\uC9C0\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \n\uD558\uB098\uB9CC \uB0A8\uACA8 \uC8FC\uC154\uC57C \uC815\uD655\uD55C \uB370\uC774\uD130\uB97C
        \uC5BB\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_unresolved_object
    sourceText: The device cannot read one clear object. Draw one concrete object.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5B4...\uBB58 \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2E0\uAC74\uC9C0 \uC798 \uBAA8\uB974\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uB2E4\uC2DC \uD55C\uBC88 \uADF8\uB824\uC8FC\uC2E4 \uC218 \uC788\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uAE4C?\n\uC0C9\uAE54\uB3C4
        \uC798 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD558\uC2DC\uBA74 \uB354 \uC54C\uC544\uBCF4\uAE30 \uC27D\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_mismatch
    sourceText: The label does not match the drawing. Enter the name of the subject
      shown in the drawing.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8\uC774 \uADF8\uB9BC\uACFC \uC77C\uCE58\uD558\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB294
        \uAC83 \uAC19\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uADF8\uB9BC\uC5D0 \uB9DE\uB294 \uB300\uC0C1\uC758
        \uC774\uB984\uC744 \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_action_or_abstract
    sourceText: 'LABEL: ACTION OR ABSTRACT'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8: \uD589\uB3D9 \uB610\uB294 \uCD94\uC0C1 \uAC1C\uB150"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_broad_category
    sourceText: 'LABEL: CATEGORY TOO BROAD'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8: \uBD84\uB958\uAC00 \uB108\uBB34 \uB113\uC74C"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_multiple_subjects
    sourceText: 'LABEL: MULTIPLE SUBJECTS'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8: \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC774 \uC5EC\uB7EC \uAC1C \uAC80\uCD9C"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.label_classification_claim
    sourceText: 'LABEL: REMOVE CLAIM'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8: \uC8FC\uAD00\uC801 \uD45C\uD604 \uC81C\uAC70"
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_action_or_abstract
    sourceText: The label names an action or abstract idea. Enter the name of one
      concrete visible subject.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8\uC774 \uD589\uB3D9\uC774\uB098 \uCD94\uC0C1\uC801\uC778
        \uAC1C\uB150\uC744 \uB098\uD0C0\uB0C5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB208\uC5D0 \uBCF4\uC774\uB294
        \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC778 \uB300\uC0C1 \uD558\uB098\uC758 \uC774\uB984\uC744
        \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_broad_category
    sourceText: The label is a broad category. Enter one specific subject name.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8\uC774 \uB108\uBB34 \uB113\uC740 \uBD84\uB958\uB97C \uB098\uD0C0\uB0C5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC778 \uB300\uC0C1 \uD558\uB098\uC758 \uC774\uB984\uC744
        \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_multiple_subjects
    sourceText: The label names multiple subjects. Enter only one subject name.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB77C\uBCA8\uC5D0 \uB300\uC0C1\uC774 \uC5EC\uB7EC \uAC1C \uD3EC\uD568\uB418\uC5B4
        \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB300\uC0C1 \uD558\uB098\uC758 \uC774\uB984\uB9CC
        \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.probe_label_classification_claim
    sourceText: Remove wording that argues how the subject should be classified,
      valued, or understood. Keep only the subject name.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB300\uC0C1\uC744 \uC5B4\uB5BB\uAC8C \uBD84\uB958\uD558\uAC70\uB098
        \uD3C9\uAC00\uD574\uC57C \uD558\uB294\uC9C0 \uC8FC\uC7A5\uD558\uB294 \uD45C\uD604\uC744
        \uBE7C\uACE0 \uB300\uC0C1 \uC774\uB984\uB9CC \uC785\uB825\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.terminal.header.analysis_error
    sourceText: '[ANALYSIS ERROR]'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[\uBD84\uC11D \uC624\uB958]"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.status.analysis_unavailable
    sourceText: ANALYSIS UNAVAILABLE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBD84\uC11D \uC0AC\uC6A9 \uBD88\uAC00"
  - key: speaker.doctor_hwang
    sourceText: Dr. Hwang
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD669 \uBC15\uC0AC"
  - key: first_contact.narrative.delegation_arrival
    sourceText: The delegation is in position. The terminal will record their response.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC678\uACC4\uC778 \uB300\uD45C\uB2E8\uC774 \uC790\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uC549\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C \uD130\uBBF8\uB110\uB85C \uC800\uB4E4\uC758 \uBC18\uC751\uC744
        \uAE30\uB85D\uD558\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.first_category
    sourceText: We will begin with {category}. Select the terminal when you are ready.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC6B0\uC120 {category} \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC \uB370\uC774\uD130\uBD80\uD130
        \uC218\uC9D1\uD558\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC900\uBE44\uB418\uBA74 \uD130\uBBF8\uB110\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uC5D4\uD130\uB97C \uB20C\uB7EC \uC2DC\uC791\uD574 \uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.first_drawing
    sourceText: Draw one concrete object in the {category} category. One object only.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAC01\uD558\uAC00 {category}\uC5D0 \uD574\uB2F9\uD55C\uB2E4\uACE0 \uC0DD\uAC01\uD558\uC2DC\uB294
        \uAD6C\uCCB4\uC801\uC778 \uC0AC\uBB3C \uD558\uB098\uB97C \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.
        \uD558\uB098\uB9CC\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.first_label
    sourceText: Enter the name of the object. The machine needs the label to compare
      the signal.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uC758 \uC774\uB984\uC744 \uC785\uB825\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.
        \uC2E0\uD638\uB97C \uBE44\uAD50\uD558\uB824\uBA74 \uD45C\uBCF8 \uB77C\uBCA8\uC774
        \uD544\uC694\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.first_trace
    sourceText: One response trace recorded. Different objects in the same category
      should form a group.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBC18\uC751 \uC2E0\uD638 \uD558\uB098\uAC00 \uAE30\uB85D\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uAC19\uC740 \uBD84\uB958\uC758 \uB2E4\uB978 \uC0AC\uBB3C\uB4E4\uC744 \uBCF4\uB0B4\uBA74
        \uBE44\uC2B7\uD55C \uC2E0\uD638\uB07C\uB9AC \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC744
        \uAD00\uCC30\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uC744 \uAC81\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.more_samples
    sourceText: Good. We need {remaining} more different sample to stabilize the
      group.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB2E4\uB978 \uD45C\uBCF8 {remaining}\uAC1C\uB9CC
        \uB354 \uC788\uC73C\uBA74 \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC744 \uD2B9\uC815\uD574\uB0BC
        \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.category_calibrated
    sourceText: The {category} response group is stable. Calibration is complete.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "{category} \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC744 \uD2B9\uC815 \uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C {category} \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uD574\uB2F9\uD558\uB294
        \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB294 \uBC88\uC5ED\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uACA0\uB124\uC694."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.bootstrap_calibrated
    sourceText: All {count} categories are calibrated. Let us see whether it can
      translate a new signal.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uCD1D {count}\uAC1C \uBD84\uB958\uC758 \uBCF4\uC815\uC774 \uB05D\uB0AC\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC774\uC81C \uCC98\uC74C \uB4E3\uB294 \uC2E0\uD638\uB3C4 \uBC88\uC5ED\uD558\uB294\uC9C0
        \uD655\uC778\uD574 \uBCF4\uC8E0."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.translation_succeeded
    sourceText: It worked. Known categories are translating automatically; the unfamiliar
      part remains unresolved.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBCF4\uC815\uB41C \uBD84\uB958\uB294 \uC790\uB3D9\uC73C\uB85C
        \uBC88\uC5ED\uB410\uACE0, \uBAA8\uB974\uB294 \uBD80\uBD84\uB9CC \uC2E0\uD638
        \uADF8\uB300\uB85C \uB0A8\uC558\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.news
    sourceText: REDMOND UFO NEWS
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC UFO \uC18D\uBCF4"
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.pizza
    sourceText: ZAUCER PIZZA
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "Zaucer \uD53C\uC790 \uBE44\uBC00 \uC785\uAD6C"
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.elevator
    sourceText: CLASSIFIED ELEVATOR
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADF9\uBE44 \uC9C0\uD558 \uC5D8\uB9AC\uBCA0\uC774\uD130"
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.briefing
    sourceText: TRANSLATOR BRIEFING
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC678\uACC4\uC5B4 \uBC88\uC5ED\uAE30 \uBE0C\uB9AC\uD551"
  - key: first_contact.placeholder.intro.footer
    sourceText: "TEMPORARY GEOMETRIC CUTSCENE  \u2022  SPACE: ADVANCE"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC784\uC2DC \uB3C4\uD615 \uCEF7\uC2E0  \u2022  \uC2A4\uD398\uC774\uC2A4:
        \uB118\uAE30\uAE30"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.raw_signal
    sourceText: 'SIGNAL: {signal}'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2E0\uD638: {signal}"
  - key: dialogue.advance.first
    sourceText: "[ SPACE ]  NEXT  \u25BC"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ SPACE ]  \uB2E4\uC74C  \u25BC"
  - key: dialogue.advance.repeat
    sourceText: "[ SPACE ]  \u25BC"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ SPACE ]  \u25BC"
  - key: first_contact.narrative.preflight_intro
    sourceText: 'Before they arrive, I need to see whether you can produce a usable
      visual probe. '
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB370\uC774\uD130 \uC218\uC9D1\uC744 \uC2DC\uC791\uD558\uAE30 \uC804\uC5D0
        \uC800\uB791 \uBA3C\uC800 \uC5F0\uC2B5\uC744 \uD574\uBCF4\uC2DC\uC8E0 \uAC01\uD558. "
  - key: first_contact.narrative.tablet_tools
    sourceText: The three illuminated controls are the brush, fill, and eraser.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC9C0\uAE08 \uC810\uB4F1\uB41C \uC138 \uBC84\uD2BC\uC740 \uD39C, \uCC44\uC6B0\uAE30,
        \uC9C0\uC6B0\uAC1C\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.tablet_style
    sourceText: These buttons change line width. Use the slider beside them to choose
      a color.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774 \uBC84\uD2BC\uB4E4\uC740 \uC120 \uAD75\uAE30\uB97C \uBC14\uAFB8\uACE0,
        \uC606\uC758 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC774\uB354\uB85C \uC0C9\uC744 \uACE0\uB97C \uC218
        \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.tablet_history_and_send
    sourceText: Use these to undo, redo, or clear the canvas. When the drawing is
      ready, press Enter.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uCABD\uC740 \uC21C\uC11C\uB300\uB85C \uC804\uCCB4 \uC0AD\uC81C,
        \uC2E4\uD589 \uCDE8\uC18C, \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC2E4\uD589\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.preflight_drawing
    sourceText: Draw one concrete object. No words, symbols, scenes, or extra objects.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uBB3C\uC744 \uC544\uBB34\uAC70\uB098 \uB531 \uD558\uB098\uB9CC
        \uADF8\uB824\uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624.\n\uAE00\uC790\uB098 \uAE30\uD638, \uBCF5\uC7A1\uD55C
        \uC7A5\uBA74\uC740 \uC548 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n\uC0C9\uAE54\uB3C4 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD574\uC11C
        \uADF8\uB824 \uC8FC\uC2DC\uBA74 \uC54C\uC544\uBCF4\uAE30\uAC00 \uC27D\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.narrative.preflight_passed
    sourceText: Good enough. We have seen what we need; the practice sample will
      not be recorded.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC88B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC0DD\uAC01\uBCF4\uB2E4 \uAF64 \uC798 \uADF8\uB9AC\uC2DC\uB294\uAD70\uC694,
        \uAC01\uD558."
  - key: first_contact.terminal.header.probe_preflight
    sourceText: '[PROBE PREFLIGHT]'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[\uD45C\uBCF8 \uC0AC\uC804 \uC810\uAC80]"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.response_channel_closed
    sourceText: 'RESPONSE CHANNEL: CLOSED'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBC18\uC751 \uCC44\uB110: \uB2EB\uD798"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.preflight_complete
    sourceText: PREFLIGHT COMPLETE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0AC\uC804 \uC810\uAC80 \uC644\uB8CC"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.line.probe_check_overridden
    sourceText: 'PROBE CHECK: OVERRIDDEN'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD45C\uBCF8 \uAC80\uC0AC: \uC218\uB3D9 \uC2B9\uC778"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.prompt.check_drawing
    sourceText: PRESS ENTER TO CHECK
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "ENTER: \uAC80\uC0AC"
  - key: first_contact.terminal.channel.local_preflight
    sourceText: LOCAL PREFLIGHT
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB0B4\uBD80 \uC0AC\uC804 \uC810\uAC80"
  - key: ui.title.game_title
    sourceText: DOODLE DIPLOMACY
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: DOODLE DIPLOMACY
  - key: first_contact.doctor_hwang.pattern_meaning_requested
    sourceText: A new response pattern is stable, but its meaning is unknown. Compare
      the samples and enter the meaning you want the translator to use.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0C8\uB85C\uC6B4 \uBC18\uC751 \uD328\uD134\uC774 \uAD00\uCC30 \uB418\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uC81C\uCD9C\uD558\uC168\uB358 \uB77C\uBCA8\uB4E4\uC744 \uBCF4\uACE0 \uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC5D0
        \uC774\uB984\uC744 \uBD99\uC5EC\uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.exit_vehicle
    sourceText: Exit the vehicle.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uCC28\uC5D0\uC11C \uB0B4\uB9AC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.follow_director
    sourceText: Follow the director.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAD6D\uC7A5\uC744 \uB530\uB77C\uAC00\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.use_elevator
    sourceText: Enter the elevator.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5D8\uB9AC\uBCA0\uC774\uD130\uC5D0 \uD0C0\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.follow_to_briefing
    sourceText: Follow the director to the briefing room.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAD6D\uC7A5\uC744 \uB530\uB77C \uBE0C\uB9AC\uD551\uC2E4\uB85C \uC774\uB3D9\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.take_briefing_seat
    sourceText: Take your seat.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uB9AC\uC5D0 \uC549\uC73C\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.follow_to_meeting
    sourceText: Follow the director to the meeting room.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uAD6D\uC7A5\uC744 \uB530\uB77C \uD68C\uB2F4\uC7A5\uC73C\uB85C \uC774\uB3D9\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.objective.enter_meeting
    sourceText: Enter the meeting room.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD68C\uB2F4\uC7A5\uC5D0 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uAC00\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.prompt.exit_vehicle
    sourceText: '[ E ]  EXIT VEHICLE'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ E ]  \uCC28\uC5D0\uC11C \uB0B4\uB9AC\uAE30"
  - key: first_contact.intro.prompt.use_elevator
    sourceText: '[ E ]  USE ELEVATOR'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ E ]  \uC5D8\uB9AC\uBCA0\uC774\uD130 \uC774\uC6A9"
  - key: first_contact.intro.prompt.sit
    sourceText: '[ E ]  SIT'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ E ]  \uC549\uAE30"
  - key: first_contact.intro.prompt.enter_meeting
    sourceText: '[ E ]  ENTER MEETING ROOM'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "[ E ]  \uD68C\uB2F4\uC7A5 \uC785\uC7A5"
  - key: first_contact.news.station
    sourceText: KSEA 7 NEWS
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "KSEA 7 \uB274\uC2A4"
  - key: first_contact.news.vhs.banner
    sourceText: ARCHIVE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uB8CC\uD654\uBA74"
  - key: first_contact.news.vhs.status
    sourceText: "AMATEUR VIDEO \xB7 REDMOND"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2DC\uBBFC \uC81C\uBCF4 \uC601\uC0C1 \xB7 \uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC"
  - key: first_contact.news.vhs.headline
    sourceText: UNIDENTIFIED OBJECT SEEN OVER REDMOND
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC \uC0C1\uACF5 \uBBF8\uD655\uC778 \uBE44\uD589\uBB3C\uCCB4
        \uD3EC\uCC29"
  - key: first_contact.news.vhs.caption
    sourceText: This footage was submitted by a local resident.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2DC\uBBFC\uC774 \uC81C\uBCF4\uD55C \uCD2C\uC601 \uC601\uC0C1\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.news.reporter.banner
    sourceText: BREAKING NEWS
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC18D\uBCF4"
  - key: first_contact.news.reporter.status
    sourceText: "LIVE \xB7 REDMOND"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD604\uC7A5 \xB7 \uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC"
  - key: first_contact.news.reporter.headline
    sourceText: UFO SIGHTING CAUSES CONFUSION EAST OF SEATTLE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2DC\uC560\uD2C0 \uB3D9\uBD80 UFO \uBAA9\uACA9\uC73C\uB85C \uC2DC\uBBFC
        \uD63C\uB780"
  - key: first_contact.news.reporter.caption
    sourceText: An unidentified flying object was sighted over Redmond, east of Seattle,
      leaving residents confused.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2DC\uC560\uD2C0 \uB3D9\uBD80, \uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC \uC0C1\uACF5\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBBF8\uD655\uC778 \uBE44\uD589\uBB3C\uCCB4\uAC00 \uBAA9\uACA9\uB418\uC5B4
        \uC2DC\uBBFC\uB4E4\uC774 \uD63C\uB780\uC5D0 \uBE60\uC84C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.news.interview.banner
    sourceText: WITNESS
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uBAA9\uACA9\uC790"
  - key: first_contact.news.interview.status
    sourceText: EYEWITNESS INTERVIEW
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uD604\uC7A5 \uBAA9\uACA9\uC790 \uC778\uD130\uBDF0"
  - key: first_contact.news.interview.headline
    sourceText: '"IT DISAPPEARED INTO THE FOREST"'
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\"\uC232 \uC18D\uC73C\uB85C \uC0AC\uB77C\uC84C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4\""
  - key: first_contact.news.interview.caption
    sourceText: I saw it with my own eyes. It appeared in an instant, flashed bright
      lights, and vanished into the forest!
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB0B4 \uB208\uC73C\uB85C \uBD84\uBA85\uD788 \uBD24\uB2E4\uB2C8\uAE4C?
        \uC21C\uC2DD\uAC04\uC5D0 \uB098\uD0C0\uB098\uC11C \uBE5B\uC744 \uB9C8\uAD6C
        \uBFDC\uB354\uB2C8 \uC232 \uC18D\uC73C\uB85C \uC0AC\uB77C\uC84C\uB2E4\uB2C8\uAE4C,
        \uAE00\uC384!"
  - key: first_contact.news.oregon.banner
    sourceText: ARCHIVE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uB8CC\uD654\uBA74"
  - key: first_contact.news.oregon.status
    sourceText: "FILE PHOTO \xB7 OREGON"
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC790\uB8CC \uC0AC\uC9C4 \xB7 \uC624\uB9AC\uAC74"
  - key: first_contact.news.oregon.headline
    sourceText: SIMILAR OBJECT PHOTOGRAPHED IN OREGON
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC624\uB9AC\uAC74\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4 \uC720\uC0AC \uBE44\uD589\uBB3C\uCCB4
        \uCD2C\uC601"
  - key: first_contact.news.oregon.caption
    sourceText: Similar sightings have also been reported in Oregon.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC720\uC0AC\uD55C \uBAA9\uACA9 \uC0AC\uB840\uB294 \uACFC\uAC70 \uC624\uB9AC\uAC74\uC8FC\uC5D0\uC11C\uB3C4
        \uBCF4\uACE0\uB410\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.news.press.banner
    sourceText: LIVE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC0DD\uC911\uACC4"
  - key: first_contact.news.press.status
    sourceText: AIR FORCE BRIEFING
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uACF5\uAD70 \uBE0C\uB9AC\uD551"
  - key: first_contact.news.press.headline
    sourceText: AIR FORCE CITES WEATHER BALLOON AND NIGHT EXERCISE
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uACF5\uAD70, \uAE30\uC0C1\uAD00\uCE21\uC6A9 \uD48D\uC120\uACFC \uC57C\uAC04
        \uD6C8\uB828\uC774 \uC6D0\uC778\uC774\uB77C \uBC1C\uD45C"
  - key: first_contact.news.press.caption
    sourceText: Officials say Venus, a weather balloon, and flares from a nearby
      base appeared together by coincidence.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB2F9\uAD6D\uC740 \uAE08\uC131\uACFC \uAE30\uC0C1\uAD00\uCE21\uC6A9
        \uD48D\uC120, \uC778\uADFC \uAE30\uC9C0\uC758 \uC870\uBA85\uD0C4\uC774 \uC6B0\uC5F0\uD788
        \uACB9\uCCD0 \uBCF4\uC778 \uAC83\uC73C\uB85C \uD310\uB2E8\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4.
        \uADFC\uAC70 \uC5C6\uB294 \uC18C\uBB38 \uD655\uC0B0\uC744 \uC790\uC81C\uD574
        \uC8FC\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.ufo_archive
    sourceText: This footage of an unidentified flying object was recorded over Redmond,
      Washington.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC6CC\uC2F1\uD134 \uC8FC \uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC \uC0C1\uACF5\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBBF8\uD655\uC778 \uBB3C\uCCB4\uAC00 \uBE5B\uC744 \uC3D8\uBA70 \uB0A0\uACE0
        \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. "
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.field_reporter
    sourceText: An unidentified flying object has been sighted over Redmond, east
      of Seattle, leaving residents confused.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC2DC\uC560\uD2C0 \uB3D9\uBD80 \uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC \uC0C1\uACF5\uC5D0\uC11C
        \uBBF8\uD655\uC778 \uBE44\uD589\uBB3C\uCCB4\uAC00 \uBAA9\uACA9\uB3FC \uC2DC\uBBFC\uB4E4\uC774
        \uD63C\uB780\uC5D0 \uBE60\uC84C\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.eyewitness
    sourceText: I saw it with my own eyes! It appeared in an instant, flashed bright
      lights everywhere, then vanished into the forest!
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB0B4 \uB208\uC73C\uB85C \uBD84\uBA85\uD788 \uBD24\uB2E4\uB2C8\uAE4C\uC694?
        \uC21C\uC2DD\uAC04\uC5D0 \uB098\uD0C0\uB098 \uBE5B\uC744 \uB9C8\uAD6C \uBFDC\uB354\uB2C8
        \uC232\uC18D\uC73C\uB85C \uC0AC\uB77C\uC84C\uC5B4\uC694!"
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.redmond_photo
    sourceText: This is a still photograph of the same unidentified object seen over
      Redmond.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uB808\uB4DC\uBA3C\uB4DC \uC0C1\uACF5\uC5D0\uC11C \uBAA9\uACA9\uB41C
        \uB3D9\uC77C \uBBF8\uD655\uC778 \uBB3C\uCCB4\uC758 \uAE30\uB85D \uC0AC\uC9C4\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.air_force_explanation
    sourceText: We believe last night's lights were caused by Venus, a weather balloon,
      and a nearby base's nighttime flare exercise appearing together by coincidence.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5B4\uC82F\uBC24 \uBAA9\uACA9\uB41C \uBD88\uBE5B\uC740 \uAE08\uC131,
        \uAE30\uC0C1\uAD00\uCE21\uC6A9 \uD48D\uC120, \uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 \uC778\uADFC
        \uAE30\uC9C0\uC758 \uC57C\uAC04 \uC870\uBA85\uD0C4 \uD6C8\uB828\uC774 \uC6B0\uC5F0\uD788
        \uACB9\uCCD0 \uBCF4\uC778 \uAC83\uC73C\uB85C \uD310\uB2E8\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.news.air_force_warning
    sourceText: Be advised that spreading baseless rumors and causing public disorder
      may result in prosecution.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uADFC\uAC70 \uC5C6\uB294 \uC18C\uBB38\uC73C\uB85C \uD63C\uB780\uC744
        \uD37C\uB728\uB9B4 \uACBD\uC6B0 \uCC98\uBC8C\uBC1B\uC744 \uC218 \uC788\uC73C\uB2C8
        \uC8FC\uC758\uD558\uC2DC\uAE30 \uBC14\uB78D\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.after_news.president
    sourceText: Will people really believe this? They are not idiots. There were
      too many witnesses.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uAC78 \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC774 \uBBFF\uC744\uAE4C? \uC0AC\uB78C\uB4E4\uC774
        \uBC14\uBCF4\uB3C4 \uC544\uB2C8\uACE0. \uBCF8 \uC0AC\uB78C\uC774 \uD55C\uB458\uC774\uC5B4\uC57C\uC9C0."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.after_news.director_cover
    sourceText: It was the best option available, Mr. President.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uAC8C \uCD5C\uC120\uC774\uC5C8\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4, \uAC01\uD558."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.after_news.director_arrival
    sourceText: We are almost there.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC774\uC81C \uAC70\uC758 \uB2E4 \uC654\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.pizza_sign.president
    sourceText: Isn't this a pizza place? It is pretty quiet.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC5EC\uAE30\uB294 \uD53C\uC790\uC9D1 \uC544\uB2CC\uAC00? \uD55C\uAC00\uD558\uAD6C\uB9CC."
  - key: first_contact.intro.car.pizza_sign.director
    sourceText: Let me explain once we are inside.
    translations:
    - locale: ko-KR
      text: "\uC77C\uB2E8 \uB4E4\uC5B4\uAC00\uC11C \uC124\uBA85\uD574 \uB4DC\uB9AC\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
